# Build context hygiene. The Dockerfiles COPY only pyproject.toml, services/,
# config/ and deploy/; everything below would otherwise be shipped to the daemon
# on every build - and var/ holds the live SQLite audit chain, which must never
# be baked into an image.
.git
.venv
venv
wheels
tmp
var
models
.env
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
